        "A person's stat tiles link to their orders/bookings by ?user=."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Guards",
      "items": [
        "assertCanBeLive: no-stock piece can't go live unless made to order.",
        "setRole: the last admin can never be demoted, by anyone.",
        "setRole: an admin cannot take away their own access."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Call trace",
      "items": [
        "admin-guards.spec.ts: every Admin* field carries AdminGuard.",
